  "en": {
    "kind": "Song cycle",
    "about": [
      "A song cycle to Theodorakis's own lyrics, written during his detention. According to the composer's catalogue it was presented in Athens in 1967 and recorded in 1971 by Polydor.",
      "The 1974 Columbia double edition (2J-154-70222/3) features Giorgos Kapernaros and Maria Dimitriadi. The track list comes from MusicBrainz and includes the spoken recitations."
    ]
